# Inspection — Luật An ninh mạng 2025 và vì sao gây tranh cãi
Inspector: independent (did not receive a maker's summary)
Axis: whole
Artifact read: 03-deliverable.md (direct, full text, before opening 03-receipts.md)
Inspected-sha: d9033d765a0190df95b95d7bcdc3ebce051e3446b7e27b64d8852fd4e3e8990d
Verify scope: **Egress blocked session-wide.** One live probe attempted —
`WebFetch https://www.hrw.org/news/2024/12/11/vietnam-repeal-harmful-internet-laws`
→ `EGRESS_BLOCKED` ("Access to www.hrw.org is blocked by the network egress proxy").
**Zero external sources opened; zero sampled.** No claim in this piece can be promoted
to grade A by this inspection, and none was. Verification was therefore done by (a)
tracing every figure, date, instrument number, name and attribution in
`03-deliverable.md` back to `01-research.md` line by line, (b) internal-consistency and
arithmetic checks, (c) prose↔confidence-table cross-checking in both directions, and
(d) an independent hand word-count. This caps the truth-ceiling of the whole run at
**B** — a declared limit of the environment, not a defect of the work.

FIX-IT threshold used, stated for the record: an item is FIX-IT only if it is
**checkably false, unsupported by `01-research.md`, or self-contradictory as
shipped**. Everything I would merely have written differently is in the non-blocking
minors list and does not enter the verdict.

Order of work: the deliverable was read and all findings were reached before
`03-receipts.md` was opened. The receipts audit is a separate section below and was
treated as a claim to check, not as a briefing.

---

## What passes

Traced against `01-research.md`, the following are correct in value, date and
attribution. This is the bulk of the piece and it is careful work.

**All six named traps are handled correctly in the body, except as noted in Findings:**

1. **Passage vs. effect kept distinct.** §1 line 5: "Ngày 10/12/2025 … thông qua …
   Luật có hiệu lực từ 1/7/2026 — khác hẳn ngày thông qua, hai mốc hay bị gộp làm
   một." The distinction is made explicit, in the opening, as its own point. The
   **1/1/2026 outlier is not adopted anywhere**; the table row for the effective date
   names it and correctly hedges the explanation ("nhiều khả năng nhầm với ngày hiệu
   lực của Luật Bảo vệ dữ liệu cá nhân") — matching `01-research.md` L25-29 and
   L177-180, which likewise say "likely conflation … not confirmed as an error, only
   inferred as one".
2. **Article count left unsettled.** §2 line 19: "45 điều theo một số nguồn, 58 điều
   theo nguồn khác. Bài này không chọn một số làm chính thức." Matches research L14-16
   and L174-176. No settled figure is smuggled in elsewhere.
3. **HRW correctly dated and correctly aimed.** §3 line 29 dates the statement
   11/12/2024, ties it to Nghị định 147/2024 and Luật An ninh mạng 2018
   (24/2018/QH14), states in terms that it is "không phải luật 2025", and goes
   further — it names the misattribution ("các bản tóm tắt gọi đây là 'HRW lên án luật
   2025' dường như suy diễn từ tuyên bố 2024 sang luật mới") and refuses it. Matches
   research L96-106. This is the highest-risk item in the topic and it is handled
   better than "not wrong".
4. **VCCI as draft-stage consultation.** §3 line 25: "Đây là góp ý dự thảo, không phải
   phản đối sau thông qua." Matches research L82-90.
5. **No unnamed critics.** The piece explicitly declines the move: "bài này không viết
   'doanh nghiệp nước ngoài phản đối' khi không ai được nêu tên" (line 25), and for the
   centralisation strand states plainly that the fact store records no named critic
   (line 27). The research's own unnamed "general critique … across rights-focused
   commentary" (research L116-121) is *omitted* from the piece rather than laundered
   into an attributed objection — the right call.
6. **Four instruments kept distinct.** Luật 116/2025/QH15, Luật 24/2018/QH14, Nghị
   định 147/2024 and Luật Bảo vệ dữ liệu cá nhân 91/2025/QH15 each appear with their
   own number and never merge. Line 31 actively dismantles the "bundled package"
   framing (passed 26/6/2025, effective 1/1/2026, ~six months apart, commentary-only
   framing) — matching research L135-146 and L190-193.

**Figures and instrument numbers — all trace:** 434/443 and 91,75% (research L23);
1/7/2026 (L25); 10/12/2025 and khoá XV (L18); 116/2025/QH15, 86/2015/QH13,
35/2018/QH14, 24/2018/QH14 (L14, L30-33); 24 giờ / 6 giờ with Điều 13 as the trigger
article (L54-58); the separate 24 giờ / 3 giờ user-information window flagged as
possibly a different obligation and explicitly not merged (L61-68, L181-184);
91/2025/QH15 passed 26/6/2025, effective 1/1/2026 (L135-137); 11/12/2024 for HRW
(L96-98).

**Every source named in the confidence table appears in `01-research.md`** against the
same claim — all 20 rows checked one by one: baochinhphu.vn/nhandan.vn (vote,
prohibited-content expansion), luatvietnam.vn/frasersvn.com/EY Vietnam (effective
